From af2a1525db6f36975f6b20fb9b4a782429568684 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:35:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Support the current version of XEP-0424 message retraction in
 MAM

Retraction messages with a top-level <retract xmlns='urn:xmpp:message-retract:1'/>
element now retract archived messages, next to the older fasten form.
Group chat messages are referred to by the stanza ID assigned by the room,
other messages by their 'id' attribute, which is stored as the origin ID
when the message has no origin-id element. Tombstones follow the version
of the retraction, and mod_mam advertises urn:xmpp:message-retract:1 and
its #tombstone feature.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ETaRHXo1LmPHqZB9SXMucM
